        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Willi Forst, Brian Robbins, H.K. Breslauer\n- Films: Oh, Dear Augustine\n- Roles: actor, screenwriter, film director, film producer, singer, television director, television producer\n\nFacts:\n- Willi Forst, born Wilhelm Anton Frohs on 7 April 1903 and deceased on 11 August 1980, was an Austrian actor, screenwriter, film director, film producer, and singer.\n- Oh, Dear Augustine, also titled Oh, du lieber Augustin in German, is a 1922 Austrian silent film directed by H.K. Breslauer and starring Willi Forst.\n- Brian Levine, born on November 22, 1963 and best known as Brian Robbins, is an American actor, film director, film producer, television director, television producer, and occasional screenwriter.",
